<title>USA: Optek Technology hires Collinsworth as CFO.</title>
<headline>Optek Technology hires Collinsworth as CFO.</headline>
<dateline>NEW YORK 1996-12-05</dateline>
<text>
<p>Optek Technology Inc said it hired William Collinsworth as chief financial officer, effective immediately.</p>
<p>Collinsworth, 46, replaces Vince Marley, who died in March.</p>
<p>Collinsworth was most recently chief financial officer of a local Dallas company, which Optek did not name.</p>
